SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart (July 16th) 
DESCRIPTION:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart!\nHello everyone\,\n
 \nPlease join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs with
  Heart!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\, nature\, the fut
 ure\, the past\, the present\, spirituality and the search for meaning in 
 life :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps://youtu.be
 /vei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful son
 gwriting\n* Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n* Life reflec
 tion and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help you understand yourself bett
 er\n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs about
  ordinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the sea
 rch for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting a
 t 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve F
 lemming\n(Canadian Folk\, Country and Adult Contemporary)\nhttps://www.you
 tube.com/@SteveFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents:
  Songs with Heart (Thursday\, August 6th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemmi
 ng's songs explore the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\
 , imagination\, and heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, r
 ock\, blue eyed soul\, and singer-songwriter traditions\, his work touches
  on themes of love\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness
 \, personal growth\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning. His songs 
 often feature memorable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical ques
 tions\, and a deep curiosity about life and human nature. Whether telling 
 a story\, sharing a life lesson\, expressing a romantic sentiment\, or ref
 lecting on the state of the world\, his music seeks to inspire thought\, c
 onnection\, compassion\, and a greater appreciation for the journey we all
  share\n\n**Songs containing:**\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional hon
 esty\n* Genuine craftsmanship\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemmin
 g is a prolific folk-country songwriter\; whose songs explore ordinary peo
 ple\, gratitude\, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the se
 arch for meaning.\n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis so
 ngs explore freedom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wi
 sdom hidden in ordinary life.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\
 n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer o
 r pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribu
 te is greatly appreciated to help support these wonderful intimate evening
 s among music lovers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.
 us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
